values ('digital_multimeter', 'rubber_holster', 9, 'Rubber Holster', 'Protective rubber cover that absorbs shock from drops and insulates the case. It often includes a tilt stand and probe storage.', 'Leave the holster on during use. Use the stand to tilt the meter for reading on the bench.', array['Do not use the meter if the case or holster is cracked or has exposed internal parts.']::text[], 'rubber_holster')
